      "description": "A person's public profile and recent activity in one call. user = id, profile URL or exact slug (case-sensitive). Returns display name, ids, member since, karma and AF karma (live; karma includes votes on their wiki edits and is not the sum of their items' scores), AF membership, post and comment counts (site counters, approximate; the post count excludes coauthored posts), the bio and the "how I can help / how others can help me" texts, job, organization and links, pinned posts, and limit items in each of: top posts by karma, latest posts, latest comments (each with its post and who it replies to), sequences, and recent wiki edits. Coauthored posts are included. Event and meetup posts are not listed here; they open by id and can appear in search. af_only limits the post, comment and sequence sections to AF items (the profile and wiki edits are unchanged; the comment section then checks the person's latest 500 comments). Each section ends with the call that continues it (list_posts, list_comments, list_sequences or get_history, with a cursor that starts after the items shown).

