    {
      "annotations": {
        "destructiveHint": false,
        "idempotentHint": true,
        "openWorldHint": true,
        "readOnlyHint": true,
      },
      "description": "Links between posts and wiki pages. post=…: incoming = posts whose current text links to this post, as the forum's link index records them (only links in post bodies count, not comments, wiki pages, sequences or profiles; the forum leaves out linking posts with zero or negative karma; links via a comment link or an old #anchor can be missing; the list reflects each linking post's text as of its last edit, so a linking post's date is not the date the link was added); outgoing = every link in this post's current text, with forum links resolved to titles or names (each post and comment with its id and AF status) and external links grouped by site. tag=…: incoming = the wiki pages the forum's link index records as linking here, often only some of them (the forum keeps no list of posts linking to a tag; links to a lens are not recorded, so a lens slug gives its page's list); outgoing = the links in the wiki text (for a lens slug, in that lens's text). direction: both (default), incoming, outgoing. sort (incoming posts only): top (karma; default), new, old; new and old rank at most 2,000 linking posts; wiki-page backlinks come newest page first and take no sort. For sort top, this server reads up to about the 2,000th result in this order, and rankings can shift between pages as votes arrive. af_only keeps AF posts and comments among the links; links to wiki pages, people and external sites have no AF status and are kept; with tag and direction incoming it is refused. limit counts incoming items; outgoing links are listed in order of first appearance and continue with the cursor.

