      },
      "description": "Votes, agreement, likes and reactions on one post, comment or wiki page, in detail (exactly one of post, comment, tag; a lens slug gives that lens's own votes). Returns karma (LessWrong) and the number of votes, both usually including the author's automatic self-vote; AF karma and AF votes for AF items; the agreement score and number of agreement votes (comments only; posts have no agreement voting); for wiki pages and lenses, the page's own score, its votes and who liked it (likes on the page itself, not on its posts); and each reaction added or seconded more often than disputed, with its name, net count, who added it, who seconded it, who disputed it, and the exact passage it is attached to when it is anchored to a quote. Reactor and liker names are as of the item's last vote. If a comment's post hides comment karma, its scores and reactions are unavailable ("karma hidden on this post"); a debate turn has just karma and reactions. An item the forum refuses to logged-out readers gives not_public; other items that are not publicly visible read as not found.

